---
description: No ready GLB → event stays draft
alwaysApply: true
---

Never publish an event without `avatars.ready` and a real `glb_url`. No scan stays `draft`.

- Not on `/events`
- `/e/[slug]` 404s (even for the athlete)
- `placeholder.glb` only on `/e/demo`
- Do not fall back to the placeholder on real event pages
- Do not insert or update `status = live` without a ready GLB
- Do not edit `/` or `components/landing`
